Decoder provenance
==================

Imported unchanged from the supplied boot.tgz:
boot/ATF/arm-trusted-firmware-2.3/lib/lzma/LzmaDec.c
boot/ATF/arm-trusted-firmware-2.3/include/lib/lzma/{LzmaDec.h,Types.h}
boot/ATF/arm-trusted-firmware-2.3/lib/zlib/

LZMA decoder: Igor Pavlov, public domain (2009/2010).
zlib decoder: zlib 1.2.11, zlib license retained in zlib.h.
Only the decompression sources are built, with Z_SOLO and no libc allocator.
The bounded allocator and format validation live in ../decompress.c.
